    {
      "title": "Zero corrections, 7d, by node",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not evidenced.** `puppet_changes_total` is a fleet-wide counter with no `node` label (it is counted once per report at collection time, by kind, across the whole fleet), so \"which nodes corrected nothing this week\" cannot be read from it. Telling a stable node apart from one that has quietly stopped enforcing needs a per-node corrective counter, which does not exist yet."
      },
      "id": 1022760650
    },
