      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not evidenced.** Two rows the charter asks for:\n\n- **Failed on Consecutive Runs** needs a failure history per resource across runs. `puppet_status` and `puppet_report_resources` both describe the latest report only.\n- **Failures by Resource Type** needs `puppet_report_resources` broken down by type as well as by state, which the collector does not currently emit.\n\nBoth are real follow-up work."
