      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 62
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not evidenced, and deliberately held rather than built.** The charter calls this the honest gap list and quietly the best panel the board set could own: separating \"we scan for it\" from \"we enforce it\" needs a mapping from each CIS benchmark rule to the Puppet resource types that would satisfy it, held in one place rather than hand-built per board. That is the charter's rule 17, \"boards are views over one evidence model, not bespoke SQL per standard\" \u2014 and rule 17 is on hold in the charter's own open threads, pending a decision that a team taking the project over should make rather than inherit half-built."
      },
